{"log_id":"202611062357253B41490D847509A38AA9","code":0,"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7492994816762989630","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/67b1bfab24b300ef20584b0f68f69b5c~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799164647&x-signature=RMSNbSPcworLGYroEBE1c%2B0dpKg%3D","duration":11738,"title":"九皇子是女儿身","video_desc":"九皇子楚狸一副女儿身，阴差阳错和楚棣迟一夜贪欢、与少年将军秦牧羽日久生情，无心争储却被卷入夺嫡之争，在机缘巧合下总坏楚棣迟的事儿。得知楚皇真面目的楚狸为保住亲人，与楚棣迟联手夺储，竟当上了新皇。该短剧改编自番茄小说《皇叔求放过，九皇子是女儿身》，作者【一口五头猪】。","series_id":"7492705344376802328","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062357253B41490D847509A38AA9\",\"rank\":\"1\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7492705344376802328\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.1805915832519531,\\\"finish\\\":0.030675802379846573,\\\"like\\\":0.07696083933115005,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.3052088022232056,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.23752084374427795,\\\"collect\\\":0.0534033365547657,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.05185932293534279}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7492705344376802328","play_cnt":363239,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"硕才短剧","sub_title":"爱情·古风爱情","score":"8.0","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":85,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5051,\"name\":\"古风爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://cate